you learned his mood had been low in the past two months. He does not go out anymore and stays
at home most of the time because he lacks energy. He has a poor appetite and has lost almost 10
kg. Based on your diagnosis of severe depression, you advise him to be started on
antidepressants. He refuses and says: “Oh, doctor. | am not depressed. This is what everybody
says. But | am just exhausted. You were too if in my place.” Which one of the following is the
