Question ID 1000
Title Diagnosing the cause of recent onset eccentric behaviour in a woman
Category Psychiatry / Drus & Alcohol Abuse > Mood disorders > Bipolar disorder
(Flag as important
Aman brings his wife to your practice for your opinion because she has started excessive
cleaning of the house and alcohol drinking. She has a lot of fights with him and flirts with his
